          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "vātyā \"a strong wind, a gale\" is built on vāta \"wind\" (CDIAL 11505), from the root √vā \"blow\". MW sets √vā beside Latin ventus and English wind: an inherited Indo-European root."
            }
          ]
        },
